.env
.env*.local
!.env.example

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# iOS is out of scope for this Android-only app (ARCHITECTURE.md §8) — if
# `expo prebuild` is ever run without --platform android, don't commit it.
/ios

# android/ IS committed as of Phase 11 (ARCHITECTURE.md §8) — its own
# .gitignore, plus the root .gitignore, exclude the actual build
# output/caches/secrets within it (build/, .gradle/, local.properties,
# keystore.properties, *.keystore). Do not re-add a blanket /android rule
# here.
